url: https://github.com/ZhuNing9527/nme-cyclic-peptide-reproducibility
version: 1.5.1
abstract: 'Reproducibility materials for HighTors: Separating Backbone and Amide Torsion Effects in N-Methylated
  Fragments and Cyclic Pentaalanines. Includes frozen Fourier models, independent Ala and retrospective
  Val validation, acquisition benchmark records, native simulation inputs, analysis source, numerical
  figure data, and the final figure-assembly scripts and supplied manual molecular images.'
